}}'''Headcage''' is a spell that the casting [[Seeker]] can utilize to protect themselves or another person from a spell or ability that targets their mind, whether it is an attack or another type of mental penetration. The spell takes the form of a green aura which surrounds the head of the target. This aura vanishes after the spell has taken effect.

== History ==
[[Zhalia Moon]] used this spell to protect herself from Joan of Arc's curse when she touched the [[Ring of Arc]]. {{source|Divide and Conquer}}

Zhalia used the spell on [[Dante Vale]] to prevent [[the Professor]] from using [[Araknos]] to control his mind. [[Sophie Casterwill]] later asked [[Zhalia Moon]] to teach her the Headcage spell. Zhalia responded that she would teach it to Sophie. {{source|The Secret of Two Generations}}

Zhalia used the spell on the whole team at [[the Professor's castle]] to protect them from the Professor's mind control. {{source|The Divine Comedy}}

{{Clear}}
